ities. The backyard is perfect for outdoor entertaining or relaxing after a long day.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss the opportunity to make this lovely property your new home! Schedule a showing today and experience all it has to offer.\r\n\r\n2 full bath\r\n\r\nFor more information, please contact: \r\nRobert Herrings\r\nJR Rentals & Property Management\r\n254-547-9994 or robertherringsjr@gmail.com\r\n\r\nYou can also text 168344 to 46835\r\n\r\nAGENT SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: http://forthoodrentalproperties.com/\r\nShowcase: https://view.paradym.com/s/Robert-Herrings-JR-Rentals--Property-Management/284510\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100063905801693\r\n\r\nCOMPANY SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: https://www.forthoodrealestate.com/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Century21PremierRealtors/\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/c21pbroker\r\nLinkedIn: https://www.Linkedin.com/in/hrherrings/\r\nPinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/jrherrings/", "channel_id": "UCZvWg96vLbA3eGHCwnf3RRQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZvWg96vLbA3eGHCwnf3RRQ", "duration": 164, "view_count": 2, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3kXTkwKWKzk", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["76522", "906 Northern Dancer Drive", "Copperas Cove TX 76522", "JR Rentals Property Managemen", "Paradym", "Robert Herrings", "Video Tour", "Virtual Tour", "VisualTour", "home for sale", "homes for sale in Copperas Cov", "real estate"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "channel": "Century 21 Premier Realtors", "channel_follower_count": 8, "uploader": "Century 21 Premier Realtors", "uploader_id": "@century21premierrealtors3", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@century21premierrealtors3", "upload_date": "20241007